<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Comm said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Comm said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst David Freedman upgraded 360 Communications Co to buy from attractive, according to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 17-3/4 on Friday.</p>
